      "ReviewText": "I did my homework before purchasing the Wild Badger. I needed power to cut through tough brush growth and this brush cutter was the right price and features that I was looking for. I was hesitant for the price that this would stand up to the reviews but it was even more powerful then the reviews said. I even upgraded to a mulching blade and it never hesitated to clear the brush. I've used many other brush cutters but the Wild Badger 52cc in my experience for the price and power out performs the rest. It is a beast!",
